Z||000000||AL||09-26-1999||01:18 PM||||<BR>hey guys,guess what? i went today to the junk yard to see if i could find anything for my 86gt fiero.i finally found one and proceded to take parts of, when this guy came up to me and said hey this looks like my fiero, but i just finished blowing the heads, so now i will probably send it to the junk yard.then his friend said well why don't you give it to him?so the guy said would you like to take it off my hands for free, i said is the car stolen or do you have papers to go with the car.he said i have everything so if you want it call me and you can take it away for free. so today i will call him, check the car out and run the vin tommarrow, and if it all checks out, i will have a v6 fiero for free, and i will start taking the heads off as soon as i can, and join the bat boy with more than 1 fiero to my name club. i will tell you guys if it panned out tomarrow.   ||||reg||6
